    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTeam Myles O'Donoghue are delighted to present Apt 4, Shackelton House, Archerswood, Clonee, Dublin 15 to the market.\n\nThis superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout, extending to approximately 73\nsq. m. The property is ideally positioned within the quiet and highly sought-after Shackelton House development and benefits from a private sunny\nbalcony overlooking landscaped communal grounds.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a generous open plan kitchen / living / dining area. The\nfully fitted kitchen integrates seamlessly with the main living space, creating an ideal area for both everyday living and entertaining. The living\naccommodation also provides direct access to the private balcony.\nThere are two well-proportioned double bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from a private ensuite bathroom. A separate family\nbathroom completes the accommodation. The property further benefits from gas fired central heating, and double glazed windows.\n\nShackelton House is a well-established residential development ideally positioned close to a wealth of local amenities including\nshops, cafs, leisure facilities and recreational amenities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within easy reach, while commuters are exceptionally well\ncatered for with easy access to the N3, M3 and M50 motorway networks, providing excellent links throughout Dublin and beyond. With its spacious accommodation, private balcony and excellent location, this property is sure to appeal to\nfirst-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\n\nFeatures\n BER C2 - BER Number 117075325\n Large Terrace\n Maintained Communal Gardens\n Gas Fired Heating\n Double Glazed PVC Windows\n\nEntrance Hall: 3.3m x 2.4m with timber floor and hot press.\n\nLiving Room: 5.6m x 4.2m with timber floor, open with dining area and access to terrace.\n\nDining Room / Kitchen: 2m x 5.2m with tiled floor, fitted units and tiled splashback\n\nBedroom 1: 5.3m x 2.8m with timber floor and fitted wardrobe.\n\nEn Suite: 1.8m x 1.7m with Walk in shower, WHB and WC. Fully Tiled\n\nBedroom 2: 4.2m x 2.9m with fitted wardrobe and timber flooring.\n\nBathroom: 2.8m x 2.1m with white suite incorporating bath with shower over, WHB and WC. Fully Tiled\n\nService Charge: Approx 2887.00\n\nManagement Company: Archerswood Management CLG\n\nPlease be advised Myles O'Donoghue Properties have not tested any appliances, apparatus, fixtures or fittings. No warranty or guarantee is given on the above, interested parties must undertake their own investigation regarding the working order of any appliances, apparatus, fixtures or fittings.\nInformation and particulars detailed on this brochure are issued by Myles O'Donoghue Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of the information and particulars they do not constitute an invitation to treat, an offer or a contract of any nature whether express or implied. All descriptions dimensions, maps, plans, artist impressions, references regarding condition, permissions, licences of use or occupation, access and any details are for guidance only and may be subject to change, without prior notification. The information and particulars are provided in good faith but no intending purchaser or tenant should rely on them as statements or representations of fact and are specifically advised to undertake its own due diligence at its own expense to satisfy itself as to the accuracy and correctness of the information and particulars given. No employees of Myles O' Donoghue Properties agents or affiliate companies make any warranty or representations whether express or implied with respect to the information and particulars and which are to the fullest extent permitted by law, disclaimed; furthermore, such parties accept no liability in respect of any loss suffered by any intending purchaser or tenant or any third party arising out of the information and particulars. Prices are quoted exclusive of applicable taxes such as VAT Stamp Duty (unless otherwise stated) and all negotiations are conducted on the basis that the purchaser / tenant shall be liable of any VAT Stamp Duty arising from the transaction.\n\n"
      },
